\n湯頭雞味重，不愧是清雞湯，那個雞油也不錯，但我覺得不突兀，但不夠融合\n兩種雲吞都特別，花椒雲吞花椒味夠，煙燻雲吞還好，整體普通但特別\n櫻桃鴨的鴨皮厲害，那個口感很棒\n油封雞胸口感還行\n煙燻里肌只有一片，吃太快了沒品嚐到\n溏心蛋很特別，有一種味道…酒味？\n叉燒飯可以給到8分，不是最好吃，但可以一口接一口\n整體來說停車位很少\n冰水一壺又一壺\n環境很乾淨\n算有個人特色的拉麵店",null,[0,53]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2418171492475180810/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRKZVdKc1RtbFdiVEZEWTFaR05HRkVWbFJpVlhCcVRrZG9TMU5IWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2418171492475180810/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRKZVdKc1RtbFdiVEZEWTFaR05HRkVWbFJpVlhCcVRrZG9TMU5IWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2418171492475180810/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRKZVdKc1RtbFdiVEZEWTFaR05HRkVWbFJpVlhCcVRrZG9TMU5IWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2418171492475180810/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRKZVdKc1RtbFdiVEZEWTFaR05HRkVWbFJpVlhCcVRrZG9TMU5IWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2418171492475180810/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRKZVdKc1RtbFdiVEZEWTFaR05HRkVWbFJpVlhCcVRrZG9TMU5IWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2418171492475180810/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRKZVdKc1RtbFdiVEZEWTFaR05HRkVWbFJpVlhCcVRrZG9TMU5IWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,3721,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJeWJsTmlWbTFDY1ZGNGFEVlRiVXBqTkdoS1NHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x77ae5dbf1068e4a7!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkIyblNiVm1CcVF4aDVTbUpjNGhKSGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJeWJsTmlWbTFDY1ZGNGFEVlRiVXBqTkdoS1NHYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJeWJsTmlWbTFDY1ZGNGFEVlRiVXBqTkdoS1NHYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJeWJsTmlWbTFDY1ZGNGFEVlRiVXBqTkdoS1NHYxILMGVCd3JyVmJucEcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rSXlibE5